# Class Reunion (windurst 82), completion parity: 410's finish with a free slot is the Lua's raw player:completeQuest
# (after the spats; then the three vars, needToZone, the fame), so a GM's Quest[2][82]Prog survives the completion
# (quest:cleanup, which a called Quest.Complete() runs, would clear it). Accepted (GM) at ClassReunionProgress 6 with
# both talked to, beside Koru-Moru.
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-120.2,-5.5,122.4 job=SMN lvl=75
quest Windurst.ThePuppetMaster completed
quest Windurst.ClassReunion accepted
charvar ClassReunionProgress 6
charvar ClassReunion_TalkedToFupepe 1
charvar ClassReunion_TalkedToFurakku 1
login
charvar Quest[2][82]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trigger Koru-Moru                       # the default's turn: 193
finish
trigger Koru-Moru                       # var 6, both talked to: 410
finish                                  # Evoker's Spats; completed; the three vars 0; needToZone; fame 20; Prog kept
